  "artha-yukta compound-phala"

  -- adjective/qualifier words that are incomplete alone.
  -- meaning arrives only when combined with the next concept.
  -- fold rule: hold this word, combine with the following concept node.
  -- e.g. "kinetic" + "energy" → kinetic-energy
  --      "electrical" + "energy" → electrical-energy
  --
  -- NOTE: "initial" and "final" are NOT modifiers.
  -- they are avastha qualifiers (purva / uttara) — handled by avastha-viveka.

